0:{"buildId":"A2KDDaJI2Oei_cuPJJym6","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Visa"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"Visa Interview Question"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"One of the most important steps to acquiring an overseas education is getting a visa. Visa is imperative to study in any foreign country. Most students dread the visa interview, as there are chances of the visa getting rejected. This would lead to a halt in your education plans. Therefore, this article provides certain tips and dos and don’ts for a visa interview. This would make your visa process much simpler and keep you calm through it."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","Cracking the Visa Interview",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Cracking the Visa Interview"}],[["$","p","Most importantly, you should have all your documents handy and be well dressed for your interview.",{"children":"Most importantly, you should have all your documents handy and be well dressed for your interview."}],["$","p","You must be on time and exude confidence and composure.",{"children":"You must be on time and exude confidence and composure."}],["$","p","You should answer confidently and provide honest answers to the visa officer. Remember, they have all your document copies and also have knowledge about your financial background. Therefore, don’t try to fool them or give false information.",{"children":"You should answer confidently and provide honest answers to the visa officer. Remember, they have all your document copies and also have knowledge about your financial background. Therefore, don’t try to fool them or give false information."}],["$","p","Be certain about your education plans and why you are choosing a particular country, course, and college. The Visa Officer wants to know why you should be allowed to go to a particular country and if you have the financial means to afford the education you have planned for.",{"children":"Be certain about your education plans and why you are choosing a particular country, course, and college. The Visa Officer wants to know why you should be allowed to go to a particular country and if you have the financial means to afford the education you have planned for."}],["$","p","Make sure to have answers for the following questions:",{"children":"Make sure to have answers for the following questions:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}],["$","section","How do you plan to sponsor your education?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How do you plan to sponsor your education?"}],[["$","p","The answers to these questions should be handled tactfully and honestly. You must always tell the visa officer that you plan to return after the course. Or if your college offers certain work opportunities after the course, then make sure to mention the same to the visa officer.",{"children":"The answers to these questions should be handled tactfully and honestly. You must always tell the visa officer that you plan to return after the course. Or if your college offers certain work opportunities after the course, then make sure to mention the same to the visa officer."}],"$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf"],"$L10"]}]]}],"$L11"]}]}],"$L12"]}],["$L13"],"$L14"]}],"isPartial":"$@15","staleTime":"$16","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L17","isPartial":"$@18","staleTime":"$16","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L19","isPartial":"$@1a","staleTime":"$16","varyParams":"$1b"},{"rsc":"$L1c","isPartial":"$@1d","staleTime":"$16","varyParams":"$1b"},{"rsc":"$L1e","isPartial":"$@1f","staleTime":"$16","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@20","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@21"}
