5:["$","p","Be certain about your career and plans in case the visa officer asks about it. You should be clear as to why you have opted for a particular course and how it is aligned with your career goals.",{"children":"Be certain about your career and plans in case the visa officer asks about it. You should be clear as to why you have opted for a particular course and how it is aligned with your career goals."}]
6:["$","p","Inform the visa officer about your family in the country, which is your reason to return to the country. Make sure you know well about your finances and bank statements and be prepared to answer any questions regarding the same.",{"children":"Inform the visa officer about your family in the country, which is your reason to return to the country. Make sure you know well about your finances and bank statements and be prepared to answer any questions regarding the same."}]
7:["$","p","Make sure to know everything about your course and college- the course duration, the course content, the infrastructure of the university, the research being conducted in the university related to your course, commencement date, etc.",{"children":"Make sure to know everything about your course and college- the course duration, the course content, the infrastructure of the university, the research being conducted in the university related to your course, commencement date, etc."}]
8:["$","p","Also, have your accommodation plans ready. You should know beforehand where you would stay. The visa officer needs to know that you are prepared to go and have made all the arrangements.",{"children":"Also, have your accommodation plans ready. You should know beforehand where you would stay. The visa officer needs to know that you are prepared to go and have made all the arrangements."}]
9:["$","p","Do not get into arguments with the visa officer. Be polite and keep your answers precise and to the point.",{"children":"Do not get into arguments with the visa officer. Be polite and keep your answers precise and to the point."}]
a:["$","p","Never give the impression that you don’t plan to return to your country or that you have plans to immigrate and seek employment in a foreign country. You must make sure to convey that you will return once your course terminates.",{"children":"Never give the impression that you don’t plan to return to your country or that you have plans to immigrate and seek employment in a foreign country. You must make sure to convey that you will return once your course terminates."}]
b:["$","p","Lastly, don’t forget to thank the interviewer for his time and patience.",{"children":"Lastly, don’t forget to thank the interviewer for his time and patience."}]
c:["$","p","Additional readings",{"children":"Additional readings"}]
d:["$","p","Cracking the Visa Interview",{"children":"Cracking the Visa Interview"}]
e:["$","p","6 Steps to Choose a University",{"children":"6 Steps to Choose a University"}]
f:["$","p","Education Loan for Study abroad",{"children":"Education Loan for Study abroad"}]
